+ *
+ * sweetgpuucslow=1 (0112b, after G6e froze right after "registered"): log
+ * "next: <step>" and sleep SWEET_GPU_UC_PAUSE_MS before every step from the
+ * open on, so the persistent log (ufslogsecs=1) ends at the step that hangs.
  */
